Consider the following program written in pseudo-code. Assume that x and y are integers. <pre><code>
Count(x,y) {
     if (y != 1){
        if (x != 1) {
                  print("*");
                  Count(x/2, y);
                  }
            else {
                     y = y-1;
                    Count(1024, y);
                  }
      }
} </code></pre>
The number of times that the print statement is executed by the call
Count(1024,1024) is _____.
